Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||06-14-99||10:32 AM||||Ok, weird thread/question. But what triggers a Fiero related memory for you? For me it's the song "Tell me why" from "Exposé". When I had just bought my first Fiero back in '89 and took it for my very first drive through the streets of San Antonio, I turned on the radio and they were playing this song. Because I felt good about the car, I felt good about the song. Soon after I bought the cassette and it became my favourite song to play (sounded great through the in-seat speakers).<p>To this very day whenever I hear this song, I can see myself driving that black GT...
