Z||000017||lowCG||06-16-99||02:29 PM||||I just liked Ferris Bueler's sister, and the 250 California Spider always reminded me of my dad's alfa spider with the Alquati race motor.Immaculate tire fryer.Cool flic.<br>My Fiero memories are a bit strange: my time spent modifiying the suspension was an outlet for the acute stress that had accumulated in every other aspect of my life.I just kept at it as I knew it could be done,with that chassis. Was a blast to drive when I was all done too!<br>Then I sold the car,went to school. #8(
